Attraction limit reached|Building limit reached|Sign limit reached|Dinomotor limit reached|Worker limit reached|People are still using this object|no power supply|There is no connecting road here|You cannot remove this road|salary paid|People are still using this object|The attraction is broken and needs repairing|A fight has broken out, hire a guard.|An attraction has broken down, hire a repairman.|All campaign saves will be lost! Continue?|Current game data will be lost! Continue?|Previous save data will be lost! Continue?|Warning! Any unsaved data will be lost! Quit anyway?|Not enough memory to save game.|Game saved|Cash is very low! You have 3 months to improve.|The Water Course is not built correctly or not connected to the park|Exit game now?|Path|attractions|services|statistics|staff|decorations|demolition|This tutorial will show you how to build your park. First of all, you need to build roads to connect things together. Access the building menu with the Left Soft Key, or LSK, and select 'Path'. Select the 'Gravel Path' with the LSK and press '5' to place it. Now build a straight road 10 squares long.|Now we'll build rides for people to visit. In the building menu select 'Attractions'. Cycle through the rides by pressing left and right. Choose a ride with the LSK and place it with the 5 key. You can rotate it left and right using the LSK before you place it. Make sure you connect the ride's entrances and exits to the path. Now build 3 rides.|Well done! Now your visitors can use the rides. Visitors also get hungry and thirsty. You will need fountains and snack bars to satisfy them. Build one of each now, they can be found in the 'Services' menu.|Some services like the snack bar need a salesman to operate them. To hire a salesman, move the cursor over the snack bar and press 5 or the fire button to select it. Highlight the 'Hire' option and press fire to select it, then press the 5 key or LSK to hire the Salesman. Exit this screen using the LSK when this is done.|Now build benches so that your visitors can rest when they get tired. These are found in the 'Decorations' menu.|Hire a guard to keep order in the park, guards are found in the 'Staff' menu. Guards must be placed on paths.|Always look after your visitors, their needs will appear in bubbles above their heads. Build more services and decorations to make your park more pleasant.|Good job, now it is time to venture forth into the world of entertainment. Quick Help is available at all times via the '0' key. If the quick help icon at the bottom of the screen blinks then you have not read it yet.|||the browser will open as soon as you leave the game|